ipadiff
========

This project vendors code from blacktop/ipsw (https://github.com/blacktop/ipsw)
under MIT license. The vendored sources live under `internal/vendored/` and
retain their copyright headers. A copy of the upstream ipsw license is
preserved at `internal/vendored/LICENSE.ipsw`.

Upstream ipsw commit pinned at vendor time:
  d8aec666867becf32f904a1d6338f9e23efd55c1

Vendored package map:
  internal/vendored/ipsw_macho/        <- ipsw internal/commands/macho/
  internal/vendored/ipsw_ent/          <- ipsw internal/commands/ent/
  internal/vendored/ipsw_entitlements/ <- ipsw internal/codesign/entitlements/
  internal/vendored/ipsw_utils/        <- ipsw internal/utils/

Modifications to vendored code:
  - Package names changed to vmacho / vent / ventitlements / vutils
  - Unused functions pruned (DiffIPSW, DiffFirmwares, *LowMemory in macho/diff.go;
    XCFramework/SwiftPackage in objc.go; Interface/WriteHeaders in swift.go;
    macOS/USB helpers in utils.go)
  - Import paths rewritten to point at vendored siblings
